###Text
Text test::indigoharbor4::text::HarbourOverview
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Indigo Harbour Upkeep Register\n\nThe register holds the buoys, beacons and tide gauges fixed on the harbour water, the hands who keep them, and the watches kept over them. Watches and keeper posts are bi-temporal, so a reader fixes both a knowledge date and an effective date to resolve one version.\n';
}
